WEBVTT

00:12:27.404 --> 00:12:30.657
going to school, I dreamed the biggest dreams.

00:12:30.657 --> 00:12:33.760
And it's because of those words
that I stand here right now

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:35.716
full of passion,

00:12:35.716 --> 00:12:38.124
asking you to be brave for the kids

00:12:38.124 --> 00:12:40.434
who are dreaming those dreams today.

00:12:40.434 --> 00:12:45.855
(Applause)

00:12:45.855 --> 00:12:50.044
You see, I want them to look at a CEO on television

00:12:50.044 --> 00:12:52.231
and say, "I can be like her,"

00:12:52.231 --> 00:12:54.738
or, "He looks like me."

00:12:54.738 --> 00:12:56.479
And I want them to know

00:12:56.479 --> 00:12:58.174
that anything is possible,

00:12:58.174 --> 00:12:59.690
that they can achieve the highest level

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:01.444
that they ever imagined,